 if rid=='bah-sending-messaging-endpoint':s+='\n## Human operator in the source narrative\n\nThe guide expressly interprets BusinessApplication broadly: it may be a payment factory or an operator entering business information. Its John Doe / Bank A example has the same person prepare payments, create the activity report at 09:00 UTC and sign at 09:50 UTC. This example supports a human-operated endpoint; it does not make every endpoint a person or assert that every sender is the authorised signatory. '+cite(p,'§2.2 p11')+' '+link(p,DOC/'examples/creation-date-example.md','Complete annotated example')+'.\n'
 s+='\n## Reviewed source diagrams\n\n'+link(p,DOC/'visual-coverage.md','MUG diagram/table coverage and precise visual-review evidence')+'.\n';put(p,s)
